WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.022 --> 00:00:01.938
- This ain't no bean patty.

00:00:01.938 --> 00:00:04.438
(swing music)

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.233
- Last Friday I had a burger for lunch

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:10.040
and then a burger for dinner.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:10.873
- If you're on a desert island,

00:00:10.873 --> 00:00:11.883
what food would you have?

00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:12.716
Cheeseburger.

00:00:12.716 --> 00:00:13.837
- I haven't had any like

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:16.111
ground or land meat for like nine years.

00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:17.350
- I had some yesterday.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.298
But ... (laughter)

00:00:18.298 --> 00:00:21.281
- I heard some murmurs
that it's pretty good.

00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:23.117
- I didn't give up meat
because it tastes bad.

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:26.714
So I still would love a
really solid substitute.

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:28.397
And I heard that this was it.

00:00:28.397 --> 00:00:30.814
(rock music)

00:00:40.948 --> 00:00:41.836
- Did you say bleeds?

00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:44.919
- I'm hoping that if this
burger is as advertised

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:47.398
that I won't have to eat meat anymore.

00:00:47.398 --> 00:00:48.993
- I'm expected to be disappointed.

00:00:48.993 --> 00:00:50.867
- Oh my God.

00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:53.648
- [Curtis] I'm pretty
excited about this right now.

00:00:53.648 --> 00:00:57.660
(dramatic classical music)

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.164
- If I didn't know better

00:00:59.164 --> 00:01:01.516
I would look at this and
think this is a burger.

00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:02.940
- It actually smells like ground beef.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.246
- Oh my God.

00:01:04.246 --> 00:01:05.942
- It looks pretty real.
- It looks pretty juicy.

00:01:05.942 --> 00:01:08.254
- Look. Wow!

00:01:08.254 --> 00:01:10.004
- One, two, three ...

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:14.541
(dramatic classical music)

00:01:15.445 --> 00:01:16.381
- What?

00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:17.788
- Yep. Tastes like a burger.

00:01:17.788 --> 00:01:19.042
- It's got a char on it,

00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:19.875
just like a burger would.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:21.104
- It kind of has that like crunch

00:01:21.104 --> 00:01:22.419
that you sometimes miss.

00:01:22.419 --> 00:01:23.648
- This can't not be meat.

00:01:23.648 --> 00:01:24.753
This is impossible.

00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:26.963
- It's really nice that you
do have to remind yourself

00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:28.440
you're eating a veggie burger.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.313
- This is light years ahead
of any other fake burger.

00:01:30.313 --> 00:01:32.312
- If you close your eyes
you can taste it more.

00:01:32.312 --> 00:01:34.232
- I'm trying not to make it
too much like a commercial,

00:01:34.232 --> 00:01:35.652
just overwhelmingly positive,

00:01:35.652 --> 00:01:37.008
but it really is that good.

00:01:37.008 --> 00:01:38.597
- I literally had a burger yesterday,

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:40.026
and like, this is just as good.

00:01:40.026 --> 00:01:42.284
- You ever have those
things that are so good

00:01:42.284 --> 00:01:44.077
you just want to
concentrate on the moment.

00:01:44.077 --> 00:01:45.681
- It looks like a real patty,

00:01:45.681 --> 00:01:46.868
which is crazy.

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:47.894
- This is coming to an end

00:01:47.894 --> 00:01:49.283
and I'm really sad about it.

00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:51.203
- If I were on a desert island

00:01:51.203 --> 00:01:53.294
and I asked for cheeseburgers
for the rest of my life,

00:01:53.294 --> 00:01:54.325
and they gave me this;

00:01:54.325 --> 00:01:55.329
I wouldn't be mad at it.

00:01:55.329 --> 00:01:56.606
- It also makes me feel good that

00:01:56.606 --> 00:01:58.016
eating something like this

00:01:58.016 --> 00:01:59.190
is doing good for the environment.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.401
- If this is the future of meatless meats,

00:02:01.401 --> 00:02:02.353
then I'm on-board.

00:02:02.353 --> 00:02:04.703
- Ladies and gentlemen,
that's finger-licking good.

00:02:04.703 --> 00:02:06.462
- This is me becoming a vegetarian.

00:02:06.462 --> 00:02:07.879
You heard it here first.

00:02:07.879 --> 00:02:11.462
(dramatic classical music)

